{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226120","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226120","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1222612001:1":{"text":"まったく、足の踏み場すらないな。お前たちも気を付けろよ。","source_cn":"简直乱得下不去脚！你们小心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x787162A19F529AB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222612002:1":{"text":"マスターは身のこなしも素早いので大丈夫――ぃぎゃああ！！","source_cn":"主人的身手可是很敏捷的——哇呀呀呀！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCA90A3A42E8D61EC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスターは身のこなしも素早いので大丈夫――ぃぎゃああ！！","female":"マスターは身のこなしも素早いので大丈夫――ぃぎゃああ！！","variant_male_record_index":"138990","variant_female_record_index":"138991","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222612003:1":{"text":"いったあ……何でこんなところに引き出しが？","source_cn":"疼死了……这里怎么会有个抽屉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AFD02D1B2832668","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222612004:1":{"text":"中身が全部外に出されてます。引き出しの中まで漁ったんですね。","source_cn":"柜子里的东西全都倒在地上了，连抽屉都没放过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD6291AD7D56CD8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222612005:1":{"text":"異変を察知して、途中で探すのを諦めたようだな。","source_cn":"看着像是听到了什么风吹草动，于是翻到一半就跑了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA355CD512265EFF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222612006:1":{"text":"つまり、また戻ってくる可能性が高いってことですよね。なら、ここで待っていれば相手が現れるかも！","source_cn":"这意味着对方返回的概率很高。我们在这里蹲守，说不定会有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90DE9B7ABA937A47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222612007:1":{"text":"よし、物は試しだ。どこか隠れる場所を探そう。","source_cn":"那就试试运气吧！我们找个地方埋伏起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7986C040D78789D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"ルカ","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}